# Shell scripts are executed inside Linux containers/VPS hosts and must
# always have LF line endings, regardless of the contributor's platform or
# git core.autocrlf setting. CRLF here breaks the `#!/bin/sh` shebang with
# "exec: no such file or directory" when the file is copied into a Docker
# image (confirmed with services/api/docker-entrypoint.sh on Windows).
*.sh text eol=lf
